OL,3,AMamdani announces plan to close New    
OL,4,AYork's Rikers Island jail by 2032      
OL,6,FNew York City's official overseeing the
OL,7,Fclosure of the city's most notorious   
OL,8,Fjail hopes a new plan from Mayor Zohran
OL,9,FMamdani will lead to "a moment of      
OL,10,Ftransformation" for how people are     
OL,11,Fdetained in the largest US city.       
OL,13,FMamdani on Friday unveiled a plan to   
OL,14,Fclose the Rikers Island complex by     
OL,15,F2032, to build four new jails and      
OL,16,Fdrastically reduce the city's detainee 
OL,17,Fpopulation.                            
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
