OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMamdani announces plan to close New    
OL,4,AYork's Rikers Island jail by 2032      
OL,6,FPlans to shutter the troubled facility 
OL,7,Fdate back to 2019, when the city       
OL,8,Fcouncil first voted to close it by this
OL,9,Fyear. But plans have been delayed over 
OL,10,Fthe years in part due to the logistical
OL,11,Fdifficulties over where to place       
OL,12,Finmates.                               
OL,14,FDana Kaplan - who Mamdani appointed as 
OL,15,Fthe city's "Close Rikers Czar" told the
OL,16,FBBC News channel on Friday that his    
OL,17,Flatest proposal is not just about      
OL,18,Fgetting rid of a decrepit facility.    
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2 
